# Files approved to use test doubles, and files whose domain vocabulary trips the text rule.
# Only the user edits this file. One entry per line, globs relative to this file's directory,
# a reason after '#'. Two forms:
#
#   <glob>  # <reason>            nothing in scripts/check_no_fakes.py runs on the file
#   <glob>  text-off  # <reason>  the comment and docstring word rule is off; every structural
#                                 rule (identifiers, stub bodies, swallowed exceptions,
#                                 fallbacks, test-double imports) still runs
#
# tests/integration/test_payments.py  # Stripe sandbox unreachable from CI
# demos/simulate_users/*  text-off  # the domain is simulation
skills/simulate-*/**  text-off  # the domain is simulation: user and environment simulators
demos/simulate-*/**  text-off  # the domain is simulation: user and environment simulators
